# The published StockLookup release artifacts are hash-verified against the sha256 values
# recorded in bundle_manifest.json, by tools/publish_release.py before promotion and by
# tests/release-smoke.test.js afterwards. This repository is checked out with
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows, which would rewrite every LF to CRLF on checkout and make
# the working-tree bytes disagree with the manifest that describes them. `-text` disables
# all end-of-line translation for exactly these files, so one release has one byte sequence
# on every platform, in the index, and on the served origin.
analysis_bundle.json            -text
bundle_manifest.json            -text
focus_extract.json              -text
statement_taxonomy_sidecar.json -text

# Deterministic line endings for the public-OSS-hardened documentation files ported from
# dashboard-runtime (see operations-review/public-oss-hardening-v1-20260818.md and
# operations-review/local-publication-assembly-v1-20260818.md). Scoped to exactly the paths
# whose content was ported in this pass — not the full dashboard-runtime set, since the
# remaining doc paths there were untouched PUBLISH_AS_IS content and AGENTS.md is held back
# pending an explicit owner decision (see report). Does not touch any other tracked file.
AI_CONTEXT.md                text eol=lf
docs/FINAL_RELEASE_AUDIT.md  text eol=lf
docs/PROJECT_COMPLETION.md   text eol=lf
docs/PROJECT_DIRECTION.md    text eol=lf
docs/PROJECT_HEALTH_AUDIT.md text eol=lf
docs/REPO_AUDIT.md           text eol=lf
